# Linux app integration (track "trayn"): notification server + system tray + XDG autostart.
# The session helper /usr/lib/aurora/helpers/aurora-sessionbus (org.freedesktop.Notifications,
# org.kde.StatusNotifierWatcher) needs python3-dbus + python3-gi (also in bluetooth.list).
# libnotify-bin: notify-send, for scripts and apps that call it.
# Legacy XEmbed tray icons are not bridged: snixembed is not in noble, xembedsniproxy only comes with plasma-workspace.
libnotify-bin
python3-dbus
python3-gi
